// LOCALHOST

### Get all contacts
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts

###

### Get single contact by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/contacts/CONTACT_ID_HERE

###

### Create a new contact
POST http://localhost:3000/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "blue",
  "birthday": "1990-01-15"
}

###

### Update a contact by ID
PUT http://localhost:3000/contacts/CONTACT_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Jane",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "favoriteColor": "green",
  "birthday": "1992-06-20"
}

###

### Delete a contact by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/contacts/CONTACT_ID_HERE
